{"ref":"BDB, עֵיפָה²","hw":"עֵיפָה²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵיפָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> gent.</strong> ‘son’ of Midian <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:4\" href=\"/Genesis.25.4\">Gn 25:4</a> (J) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.33\">1 Ch 1:33</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.6\">Is 60:6</a>, 𝔊 Γαφερ, Γεφαρ, Γαιφα(ρ).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> m.</strong> name in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:47\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.47\">1 Ch 2:47</a>, 𝔊 Γαιφα.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <strong> f.</strong> concubine of Caleb <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:46\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.46\">1 Ch 2:46</a>, 𝔊 Γαιφαηλ, A Γαιφα ἡ, 𝔊 L Γαιφα.","next":"BDB, מוּעָף²","prev":"BDB, עֵיפָה"}